# ── Local demo (default) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# `npm run demo` starts a local Postgres (no Docker needed) on port 51214,
# applies migrations, seeds the 2023 example exam and runs the site.
# With no Supabase URL set, the site runs in demo mode: no login, one local admin user.
DATABASE_URL="postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:51214/template1?sslmode=disable"
DIRECT_URL="postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:51214/template1?sslmode=disable"

# ── Supabase (production) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Replace the two URLs above and uncomment the lines below.
# Supabase → Project Settings → Database → Connection string
# DATABASE_URL = transaction pooler (port 6543, add ?pgbouncer=true)
# DIRECT_URL   = session pooler (port 5432) – used for migrations
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://<ref>.supabase.co"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="sb_publishable_..."
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY="sb_secret_..."

# Only for grading user answers in real time
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."
